{"title":"Career Roadmap: Management Consultant (after MBA stage)","role":"Management Consultant (after MBA stage)","summary":"Important pathway: IPM is an integrated 5-year management pathway combining undergraduate and postgraduate management education. The student should target consulting opportunities primarily at the MBA stage/after completing the integrated programme, rather than assuming a management-consultant role immediately after the undergraduate stage.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"Integrated Programme in Management (IPM - BBA+MBA)"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build strong foundations in business, economics, analytics and management, followed by advanced strategy, problem-solving and consulting skills"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Management Consultant helps organizations solve complex business problems and improve performance."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical consulting assignments involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Market entry"},{"text":"Growth strategy"},{"text":"Cost reduction"},{"text":"Digital transformation"},{"text":"Operating-model redesign"},{"text":"Organization design"},{"text":"Supply-chain improvement"},{"text":"Financial performance"},{"text":"Customer strategy"},{"text":"M&A-related analysis"},{"text":"Technology strategy"},{"text":"Implementation support"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The core consulting workflow is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem Definition","Hypothesis","Data Collection","Analysis","Insights","Recommendation","Client Presentation","Implementation"]},{"type":"p","text":"For an IPM student, the strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Fundamentals","Quantitative Ability","Structured Problem Solving","Communication","Analytics","Industry Knowledge","Leadership"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the 5-Year IPM","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business foundation"},{"text":"Economics, accounting, mathematics, communication"},{"text":"Business case analysis"},{"text":"Weak quantitative foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"},{"text":"Statistics, finance, marketing, operations"},{"text":"Data-driven business project"},{"text":"Memorizing concepts without application"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Business problem solving"},{"text":"Strategy, analytics, organizational behaviour"},{"text":"Consulting-style case project"},{"text":"Weak problem structuring"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced management"},{"text":"Corporate strategy, finance, operations, digital business"},{"text":"Industry consulting project"},{"text":"No industry exposure"}],[{"text":"Year 5"},{"text":"MBA-level consulting readiness"},{"text":"Strategy, electives, leadership, advanced analytics"},{"text":"Internship + consulting capstone"},{"text":"Entering placements without case preparation"}]]}]},{"heading":"IPM Roadmap by Year","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Mathematics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Computer applications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Presentation skills"},{"text":"Business writing"},{"text":"Quantitative reasoning"},{"text":"Reading business news"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Business Model Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a company and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Revenue model"},{"text":"Cost structure"},{"text":"Competition"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Growth opportunities"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Functional Business Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"},{"text":"Human Resource Management"},{"text":"Operations Management"},{"text":"Business Research"},{"text":"Financial Management"},{"text":"Management Accounting"},{"text":"Business Law"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market sizing"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Cost structures"},{"text":"Business processes"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Industry Analysis Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Select an industry such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Automobile"},{"text":"Aviation"},{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"Technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Market","Customers","Competitors","Economics","Trends","Opportunities","Risks"]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Consulting Skill Development","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should begin thinking like a consultant."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategic Management"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Corporate Finance"},{"text":"Operations Strategy"},{"text":"Competitive Strategy"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"Research Methods"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop structured problem solving."},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting Problem Structure"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of asking:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Why are sales falling?\""},{"type":"p","text":"Break it into:"},{"type":"h","text":"Revenue = Customers × Average Revenue per Customer"},{"type":"p","text":"Then investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"New customer acquisition"},{"text":"Existing customer retention"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Product mix"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Channel"},{"text":"Customer segment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is issue-tree thinking."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — MBA-Level Business Capability"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop deeper knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate strategy"},{"text":"Competitive advantage"},{"text":"Business transformation"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Operations strategy"},{"text":"Digital transformation"},{"text":"International business"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Organizational change"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Choose electives based on target consulting area."},{"type":"h","text":"Strategy Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital transformation"},{"text":"Information systems"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Technology strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Process improvement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Financial modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 5 — Consulting Placement & Internship"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus heavily on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Case interviews"},{"text":"Consulting internship"},{"text":"Business problem solving"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Industry research"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Leadership"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a consulting-ready portfolio."}]},{"heading":"Core Consulting Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A consultant should be able to convert a vague problem into a structured analytical problem."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Client:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Our profits have declined.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Break down:"},{"type":"h","text":"Profit = Revenue − Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"Then:"},{"type":"h","text":"Revenue"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Volume"},{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Product mix"},{"text":"Customer mix"},{"text":"Geography"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cost"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fixed costs"},{"text":"Variable costs"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Labour"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Overheads"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then identify where the largest change occurred."},{"type":"p","text":"Frameworks should support thinking rather than replace it. Interviewers and real clients expect the consultant to adapt the structure to the actual problem."}]},{"heading":"Strategy Concepts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competitive advantage"},{"text":"Market positioning"},{"text":"Industry structure"},{"text":"Economies of scale"},{"text":"Network effects"},{"text":"Switching costs"},{"text":"Entry barriers"},{"text":"Differentiation"},{"text":"Cost leadership"},{"text":"Vertical integration"},{"text":"Horizontal integration"},{"text":"Diversification"},{"text":"Market entry"},{"text":"Growth strategy"},{"text":"Business-model innovation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful analytical tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SWOT"},{"text":"PESTLE"},{"text":"Porter's Five Forces"},{"text":"Value Chain"},{"text":"BCG Matrix"},{"text":"Ansoff Matrix"},{"text":"Business Model Canvas"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These should be used selectively rather than mechanically."}]},{"heading":"Market Sizing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Market sizing is a core consulting skill."},{"type":"h","text":"Top-Down"},{"type":"flow","items":["Total Market","Relevant Segment","Target Market"]},{"type":"h","text":"Bottom-Up"},{"type":"h","text":"Number of Customers × Annual Spend per Customer"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Suppose:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2 million potential customers"},{"text":"10% target segment"},{"text":"₹5,000 annual spend"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then:"},{"type":"h","text":"Estimated market = 2,000,000 × 10% × ₹5,000"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should clearly state assumptions and test whether they are realistic."}]},{"heading":"Financial Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial Statements"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income statement"},{"text":"Balance sheet"},{"text":"Cash-flow statement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Key Metrics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue growth"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"EBITDA margin"},{"text":"Operating margin"},{"text":"ROIC"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Free cash flow"},{"text":"Debt/equity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Economics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fixed cost"},{"text":"Variable cost"},{"text":"Contribution margin"},{"text":"Break-even"},{"text":"Unit economics"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Payback period"}]}]},{"heading":"Excel & Financial Modelling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"IFERROR"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"},{"text":"Sensitivity analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue models"},{"text":"Cost models"},{"text":"Profitability models"},{"text":"Forecasts"},{"text":"Scenario models"},{"text":"Business cases"}]}]},{"heading":"PowerPoint & Consulting Communication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Consultants frequently communicate complex analysis through concise presentations."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Executive summaries"},{"text":"Slide structuring"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Recommendation slides"},{"text":"Issue trees"},{"text":"Decision slides"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong consulting slide should communicate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Insight","Evidence","Implication","Recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid slides containing large amounts of unstructured text."}]},{"heading":"Data & Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern consultant should be data-literate."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced level."},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"HAVING"},{"type":"p","text":"ORDER BY"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"CTEs"},{"type":"p","text":"Subqueries"},{"type":"p","text":"Window Functions"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"KPI analysis"},{"text":"DAX fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Recommended libraries:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Python is useful but is not mandatory for every management-consulting role."}]},{"heading":"Consulting Case Interview Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start serious case preparation before the final placement stage."},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"h","text":"Profitability Cases"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue decline"},{"text":"Cost increase"},{"text":"Margin compression"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Market Entry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"New country"},{"text":"New product"},{"text":"New customer segment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Growth"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue expansion"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Product expansion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pricing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Price increase"},{"text":"Pricing strategy"},{"text":"Discount optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Capacity"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Productivity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M&A"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acquisition attractiveness"},{"text":"Synergies"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Integration"}]}]},{"heading":"Quantitative Skills for Consulting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Be comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Percentages"},{"text":"Ratios"},{"text":"Growth rates"},{"text":"CAGR"},{"text":"Weighted averages"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Break-even"},{"text":"Unit economics"},{"text":"Market sizing"},{"text":"Profit calculations"},{"text":"Currency conversion"},{"text":"Mental arithmetic"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"If revenue increases from ₹100 crore to ₹121 crore over two years:"},{"type":"h","text":"CAGR = (121/100)^(1/2) − 1"},{"type":"p","text":"≈ 10%"},{"type":"p","text":"Consulting interviews often require performing such calculations quickly and explaining the reasoning clearly."}]},{"heading":"Business Research","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industry size"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Market share"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Customer behaviour"},{"text":"Regulatory environment"},{"text":"Technology trends"},{"text":"Company financials"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Sources may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Annual reports"},{"text":"Investor presentations"},{"text":"Government statistics"},{"text":"Industry reports"},{"text":"Company filings"},{"text":"Reputable research databases"},{"text":"Primary interviews/surveys"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Always distinguish verified data from assumptions."}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Market Entry Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a company considering entry into a new market."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market size"},{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Entry barriers"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Risks"},{"text":"Economics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Final output:"},{"type":"h","text":"10–15 slide consulting presentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Profitability Improvement"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a fictional or real business experiencing declining profits."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Revenue","Cost","Product Mix","Customers","Geography"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diagnosis"},{"text":"Root causes"},{"text":"Recommendations"},{"text":"Financial impact"},{"text":"Implementation plan"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Digital Transformation Case"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a traditional company and recommend:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process digitization"},{"text":"Technology investments"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Data architecture"},{"text":"Customer experience improvements"},{"text":"Implementation roadmap"}]}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Strategic Business Transformation Consulting Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a real industry/company and produce a complete consulting engagement."},{"type":"h","text":"Phase 1 — Problem Definition"},{"type":"p","text":"Define:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client objective"},{"text":"Business problem"},{"text":"Scope"},{"text":"Key questions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Phase 2 — Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Perform:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market analysis"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Customer analysis"},{"text":"Operational analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Phase 3 — Recommendation"},{"type":"p","text":"Provide:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategic options"},{"text":"Evaluation criteria"},{"text":"Recommended strategy"},{"text":"Financial impact"},{"text":"Risks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Phase 4 — Implementation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"30-day actions"},{"text":"90-day actions"},{"text":"12-month roadmap"},{"text":"KPIs"},{"text":"Governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Deliverables"},{"type":"flow","items":["Consulting Report","Executive Presentation","Excel Model","Power BI Dashboard"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Consulting Specialization Choices","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialization","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Strategy Consulting"},{"text":"Corporate and competitive strategy"}],[{"text":"Management Consulting"},{"text":"Broad business transformation"}],[{"text":"Operations Consulting"},{"text":"Process and operational improvement"}],[{"text":"Technology Consulting"},{"text":"Digital and technology transformation"}],[{"text":"Financial Consulting"},{"text":"Finance, transactions and performance"}],[{"text":"Risk Consulting"},{"text":"Risk, controls and compliance"}],[{"text":"Supply Chain Consulting"},{"text":"Procurement, logistics and operations"}],[{"text":"Healthcare Consulting"},{"text":"Healthcare strategy and operations"}],[{"text":"Marketing Consulting"},{"text":"Customer and growth strategy"}],[{"text":"HR Consulting"},{"text":"Organization and workforce strategy"}],[{"text":"Sustainability Consulting"},{"text":"ESG and sustainability transformation"}],[{"text":"Data & AI Consulting"},{"text":"Analytics, AI and decision intelligence"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are extremely important for this pathway."},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Management consulting firms"},{"text":"Strategy consulting firms"},{"text":"Big Four consulting practices"},{"text":"Boutique consulting firms"},{"text":"Corporate strategy teams"},{"text":"Business transformation teams"},{"text":"Investment/strategy teams"},{"text":"Technology consulting"},{"text":"Operations consulting"},{"text":"Internal consulting teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also valuable:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Startup strategy"},{"text":"Founder’s office"},{"text":"Business analytics"},{"text":"Corporate development"},{"text":"Market research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Internship Responsibilities"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Business analysis"},{"text":"Client presentations"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Strategy projects"},{"text":"Process improvement"},{"text":"Dashboard development"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are secondary to academics, internships and case-solving ability."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful supplementary areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Valuation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strategy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Market analysis"},{"text":"Competitive strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"},{"text":"Digital transformation"},{"text":"AI fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For consulting recruitment, case-solving ability + academic performance + internships + communication + structured thinking generally matter more than accumulating certificates."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options After IPM","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After completing the MBA stage, realistic consulting and adjacent roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Management Consultant"},{"text":"Business Consultant"},{"text":"Strategy Consultant"},{"text":"Associate Consultant"},{"text":"Consulting Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Strategy Analyst"},{"text":"Transformation Consultant"},{"text":"Operations Consultant"},{"text":"Technology Consultant"},{"text":"Digital Transformation Consultant"},{"text":"Risk Consultant"},{"text":"Financial Advisory Analyst"},{"text":"Corporate Strategy Analyst"},{"text":"Business Transformation Analyst"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact title depends heavily on the employer and recruiting structure."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The IPM itself already incorporates the postgraduate management stage, so an additional MBA immediately after completing the programme is generally unnecessary."},{"type":"p","text":"After IPM, further study should be considered only for a specific specialization or career objective, such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Data Science"},{"text":"Specialized strategy programs"},{"text":"Public policy"},{"text":"Law"},{"text":"Specialized technology/AI programs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Work experience is often more valuable than immediately adding another general management degree."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For students considering international consulting careers, relevant master's/MBA programs include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA"},{"text":"MSc Management"},{"text":