mation"},{"text":"Data strategy"},{"text":"Operating-model redesign"},{"text":"AI governance"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Sustainability strategy"},{"text":"Supply-chain resilience"},{"text":"Cybersecurity strategy"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly automate parts of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Data preparation"},{"text":"Benchmarking"},{"text":"Presentation drafting"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, the consultant's differentiating skills will increasingly be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem Framing","Judgment","Client Communication","Industry Expertise","Data/AI Fluency","Change Management"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Organizational behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strategy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competitive strategy"},{"text":"Market entry"},{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Corporate strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Data interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem structuring"},{"text":"Hypothesis development"},{"text":"Market sizing"},{"text":"Case solving"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Executive communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Business writing"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Client management"},{"text":"Teamwork"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Portfolio Target","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By completion of the IPM, the student should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"1 market-entry consulting case"},{"text":"1 profitability-improvement case"},{"text":"1 digital-transformation case"},{"text":"1 complete strategic consulting capstone"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Business research skills"},{"text":"Strong quantitative reasoning"},{"text":"Case interview preparation"},{"text":"At least 1–2 relevant internships/projects"},{"text":"Leadership experience"},{"text":"Strong communication and presentation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["IPM","Business Fundamentals","Economics","Accounting","Statistics","Marketing","Finance","Operations","Strategy","Business Analytics","Market Research","Problem Structuring","Case Solving","Financial Modelling","Excel","Power BI","SQL","Presentation","Leadership","Consulting Internship","MBA Stage","Consulting Placement","Management Consultant","Senior Consultant","Engagement Manager","Principal/Partner"]}]}]}